    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gallagher Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this three bedroom semi detached property in the heart of Elphin, Co. Roscommon. This property is within walking distance of all town centre amenities. The accommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room with open fireplace, double doors leading to kitchen/diner, utility room & downstairs WC. First floor comprises of three bedrooms (one with ensuite) and bathroom. Small enclosed garden to rear and off street parking to the front of the property. The property has been freshly painted internally and newly carpeted. The larger towns of Carrick on Shannon, Boyle & Strokestown are within a short drive. For all viewings please contact Gallagher Auctioneers Ltd."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway 4.77m (15'8\") x 1.75m (5'9\")\r\n\r\nLiving Room 5.27m (17'3\") x 3.39m (11'1\")\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diner 5.23m (17'2\") x 2.98m (9'9\")\r\n\r\nUtility 2.07m (6'9\") x 1.52m (5'0\")\r\n\r\nWC 2.08m (6'10\") x 1.49m (4'11\")\r\n\r\nStairs to First Floor \r\n\r\nLanding 3.62m (11'11\") x 2.08m (6'10\")\r\n\r\nBedroom One 2.99m (9'10\") x 2.56m (8'5\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Two 2.98m (9'9\") x 2.58m (8'6\")\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.06m (6'9\") x 2.42m (7'11\")\r\n\r\nBedroom Three 3.16m (10'4\") x 3.11m (10'2\")\r\n\r\nEnsuite 2.01m (6'7\") x 1.97m (6'6\")"
      },
